="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21097-21109"><rb>掛</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21109-21115">け、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21115-21136"><rb>片手</rb><rt>かたて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21136-21145">には、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21145-21163"><rb>黄金</rb><rt>きん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21163-21166">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21166-21184"><rb>鎖</rb><rt>くさり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21184-21187">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21187-21208"><rb>片手</rb><rt>かたて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21208-21232">には、ヤットコを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21232-21244"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21244-21253">って、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21253-21268"><rb>街</rb><rt>まち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21268-21271">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21271-21286"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21286-21289">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21289-21310"><rb>跳出</rb><rt>とびだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21310-21334">しました。そして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21334-21358"><rb>日光</rb><rt>にっこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21358-21361">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21361-21376"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21376-21379">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21379-21391"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21391-21400">って、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21400-21415"><rb>鳥</rb><rt>とり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21415-21418">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21418-21433"><rb>眺</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21433-21439">めて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21439-21451"><rb>居</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21451-21465">ました。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-21465-21468">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21468-21483"><rb>鳥</rb><rt>とり</rt></ruby>や、」と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21495-21519"><rb>金工</rb><rt>かざりや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21519-21522">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21522-21534"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>った。「<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21546-21561"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21561-21564">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21564-21576"><rb>好</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21576-21579">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21579-21594"><rb>声</rb><rt>こえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21594-21597">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21597-21612"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21612-21633">うんだ。もう一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21633-21648"><rb>度</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21648-21657">、あの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21657-21672"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21672-21675">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21675-21690"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21690-21696">って</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21696-21708"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby>な。」</p>
        <p>「いえいえ、」と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21743-21758"><rb>鳥</rb><rt>とり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21758-21761">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21761-21773"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>った。「ただじゃア、二<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21806-21821"><rb>度</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21821-21827">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21827-21842"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21842-21878">いません。それとも、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21878-21896"><rb>黄金</rb><rt>きん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21896-21899">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21899-21917"><rb>鎖</rb><rt>くさり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21917-21920">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21920-21935"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21935-21959">さるなら、もう一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21959-21974"><rb>度</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21974-21977">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21977-21992"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby>いましょう。」</p>
        <p>「よしきた、」と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22039-22063"><rb>金工</rb><rt>かざりや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22063-22066">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22066-22078"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>った。「それ<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22096-22114"><rb>黄金</rb><rt>きん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22114-22117">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22117-22135"><rb>鎖</rb><rt>くさり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22135-22165">をやる。さア、もう一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22165-22180"><rb>度</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22180-22183">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22183-22198"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22198-22204">って</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22204-22216"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby>な。」</p>
