        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26889-26913"><rb>手巾</rb><rt>はんけち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26913-26916">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26916-26931"><rb>包</rb><rt>つつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26931-26942">んで、</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26945-26963"><rb>杜松</rb><rt>ねず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26963-26966">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26966-26978"><rb>樹</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26978-26981">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26981-27002"><rb>根元</rb><rt>ねもと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27002-27005">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27005-27017"><rb>置</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27017-27028">いた。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-27028-27073">キーウィット、キーウィット、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27073-27088"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27088-27094">と、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27094-27115"><rb>綺麗</rb><rt>きれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27115-27118">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27118-27133"><rb>鳥</rb><rt>とり</rt></ruby>でしょう！」</p>
