        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32130-32151"><rb>妹</rb><rt>いもうと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32151-32177">のマリちゃんが、</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-32177-32192">わたしの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32192-32207"><rb>骨</rb><rt>ほね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32207-32222">をのこらず</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32222-32237"><rb>拾</rb><rt>ひろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32237-32248">って、</seg></p>
