        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32307-32325"><rb>杜松</rb><rt>ねず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32325-32328">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32328-32340"><rb>樹</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32340-32343">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32343-32364"><rb>根元</rb><rt>ねもと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32364-32367">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32367-32379"><rb>置</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32379-32390">いた。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-32411-32483"><lem><seg source="#source-32393-32411">キーウィット</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-32459-32477">キイウィット</seg></rdg></app><seg source="#source-32483-32507">、キーウィット、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32507-32522"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32522-32528">と、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32528-32549"><rb>綺麗</rb><rt>きれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32549-32552">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32552-32567"><rb>鳥</rb><rt>とり</rt></ruby>でしょう！」</p>
